    "Description": "A transparency slide showing the left side of a very worn carousel pig. The skin of the pig is a light tan with some darker spots, especially the jowls and the tail, both of which are almost black. The saddle is brown and black. The saddle blanket is green with yellow flowers. The tack is red. The pig is suspended on a pole with a white backdrop. The image has small dark spots. The slide reads “PULLEN PARK CAROUSEL PULLEN PARK 16B LEFT” at the top and “S.S. RALEIGH NC WAKE CO 8.5.81” at the bottom.",
